    <value>Choose which version of each take is saved. “Match the transcription” stores what the engine actually heard — the processed signal when pre-processing is on, the raw capture otherwise. “Always raw” keeps the untouched microphone signal, so you can re-process it later against a different model.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="GeneralAudioCorpusContentMatch.Content" xml:space="preserve">
